** Interference over a weak two

After a takeout double of a weak two, responder raises with three-card support
(further preemption), redoubles with 15+ hcp, and otherwise passes. After an
overcall, responder raises with three-card support when the raise is still
available at the 3 level, doubles for penalty with 13+ hcp, and otherwise
passes; a new suit is not written. If the opponents intervene after our own
2NT ask or new suit, opener doubles with a maximum and otherwise passes
(NOTES.md "Notrump lane" #N5). `(bid)` is any overcall not listed more
specifically.

2D-(D)-
3D = 3+!d, 0--14 hcp
R = 15+ hcp

2H-(D)-
3H = 3+!h, 0--14 hcp
R = 15+ hcp

2S-(D)-
3S = 3+!s, 0--14 hcp
